# 18\. FINAL DIRECTIVE TO ALL AGENTS

This project is a business operations platform, not a collection of unrelated screens.

Every implementation decision must preserve the integrity of the overall business lifecycle.

Understand the business before changing the code.

Keep modules independent in responsibility but consistent in their shared business records.

Protect authorization, quantities, prices, document states, and financial balances.

Build incrementally, verify independently, and document important decisions.

Never invent a business rule, silently bypass an approval, or report unverified work as complete.

**The definition of success is a secure, auditable, reliable, and maintainable business platform whose complete workflows behave correctly—not merely an application that compiles or displays the expected screens.**

